# Phase 6 fine-tuning: model weights/optimizer state don't belong in git
# (checkpoint-51 alone is ~344MB including optimizer.pt; a real deployment
# would push finetune/checkpoints/*/adapter_model.safetensors to an
# artifact store/model registry instead - out of this phase's scope).
# Datasets and results (small JSON/JSONL) ARE committed - see
# finetune/data/*.jsonl, finetune/data/dataset_manifest.json,
# finetune/data/training_log.json, results/finetune_eval.json.
finetune/checkpoints/
finetune/*.log